class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">c8f05ff8-58f9-49f9-8ea7-abda1fea27d6</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:c8f05ff8-58f9-49f9-8ea7-abda1fea27d6\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:c8f05ff8-58f9-49f9-8ea7-abda1fea27d6\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>Stats</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">UNI_UND_RingOfMindShielding</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_UND_RingOfMindShielding+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_UND_RingOfMindShielding+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<dl><dt><a href=\"/wiki/Shelter\" title=\"Shelter\">Shelter</a></dt><dd>You have <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/42px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/55px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Advantage\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png/28px-Advantage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fc/Advantage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Advantage\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Saving throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving throw\">Saving throws</a> against <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Charmed_(Condition)\" title=\"Charmed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Charmed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Charmed_(Condition)\" title=\"Charmed (Condition)\">Charmed</a>.</dd></dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Ebonlake_Grotto\" title=\"Ebonlake Grotto\">Ebonlake Grotto</a> <span class=\"bg3wiki-coordinates\">X:&nbsp;144&nbsp;Y:&nbsp;29</span>: Offered by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Omeluum\" title=\"Omeluum\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Omeluum.png/25px-Portrait_Omeluum.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Omeluum.png/38px-Portrait_Omeluum.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Omeluum.png/50px-Portrait_Omeluum.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Omeluum\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/7b/Portrait_Omeluum.png/25px-Portrait_Omeluum.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/7b/Portrait_Omeluum.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Omeluum\" title=\"Omeluum\">Omeluum</a> upon completion of the quest <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Help_Omeluum_Investigate_the_Parasite\" title=\"Help Omeluum Investigate the Parasite\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/33px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/44px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Help Omeluum Investigate the Parasite\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png/22px-Quest_Map_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/69/Quest_Map_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Help_Omeluum_Investigate_the_Parasite\" title=\"Help Omeluum Investigate the Parasite\">Help Omeluum Investigate the Parasite</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Although offered by Omeluum, he does not do so for free. The player character must <a href=\"/wiki/Persuasion\" title=\"Persuasion\">persuade</a> or <a href=\"/wiki/Intimidation\" title=\"Intimidation\">intimidate</a> him, or pay for it; either with gold or by trading a story or information about the <a href=\"/wiki/Nautiloid\" title=\"Nautiloid\">Nautiloid</a>. It is also possible to pickpocket the ring, once it becomes available.</li>\n<li>This ring was originally called the <i>Ring of Psionic Protection</i> in <a href=\"/wiki/Early_Access\" title=\"Early Access\">Early Access</a>. It blocked the use of <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid_powers\" title=\"Illithid powers\">Illithid powers</a> for the wearer.</li>\n<li>This ring is particularly useful in Act One as it grants advantage on the saving throws against the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Luring_Song\" title=\"Luring Song\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Luring_Song_Icon.webp/20px-Luring_Song_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Luring_Song_Icon.webp/30px-Luring_Song_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2e/Luring_Song_Icon.webp/40px-Luring_Song_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Luring Song\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2e/Luring_Song_Icon.webp/20px-Luring_Song_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2e/Luring_Song_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Luring_Song\" title=\"Luring Song\">Luring Song</a> of the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Harpy\" title=\"Harpy\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Portrait_Harpy.png/25px-Portrait_Harpy.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Portrait_Harpy.png/38px-Portrait_Harpy.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/20/Portrait_Harpy.png/50px-Portrait_Harpy.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Harpies\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/20/Portrait_Harpy.png/25px-Portrait_Harpy.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/20/Portrait_Harpy.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Harpy\" title=\"Harpy\">Harpies</a>.</li></ul>\n\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195354\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.083 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.087 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2836/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 39385/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10190/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.024/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1205791/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   72.152      1 Template:EquipmentPage\n100.00%   72.152      1 -total\n 27.72%   19.998      9 Template:Icon_text\n 24.38%   17.591     25 Template:Trim\n 23.15%   16.703      6 Template:Icon_link\n 17.55%   12.661      3 Template:Uid\n 14.60%   10.534     10 Template:Ifempty\n 13.64%    9.839      1 Template:WeaponType\n  8.84%    6.379      3 Template:Template_style\n  8.81%    6.357      2 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:3608-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714195354 and revision id 396286. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}